[
  {
    "start": 4.08,
    "end": 7.800000000000001,
    "text": "Bitches, I'm in New York.",
    "index": 0
  },
  {
    "start": 8.515,
    "end": 10.535,
    "text": "[music]",
    "index": 1
  },
  {
    "start": 17.03,
    "end": 19.05,
    "text": "[music]",
    "index": 2
  },
  {
    "start": 40.12,
    "end": 44.76,
    "text": "Wow, I haven't been in New York or US in a minute.",
    "index": 3
  },
  {
    "start": 44.76,
    "end": 49.9075,
    "text": "This is the exact terminal I'd always get out on when I would go to high school.",
    "index": 4
  },
  {
    "start": 49.9075,
    "end": 50.925,
    "text": "Terminal 4.",
    "index": 5
  },
  {
    "start": 50.925,
    "end": 52.96,
    "text": "It's been a long time.",
    "index": 6
  },
  {
    "start": 64.4,
    "end": 68.16000000000001,
    "text": "All right, let's keep it moving.",
    "index": 7
  },
  {
    "start": 78.52,
    "end": 82.56,
    "text": "So, I'm staying at my friend's in Long Island City.",
    "index": 8
  },
  {
    "start": 82.56,
    "end": 87.22571428571429,
    "text": "I was supposed to get a package to Spain for work, and it ended up just being stuck in customs.",
    "index": 9
  },
  {
    "start": 87.22571428571429,
    "end": 88.57729729729729,
    "text": "So, instead I flew to New York to pick it up.",
    "index": 10
  },
  {
    "start": 88.57729729729729,
    "end": 93.72,
    "text": "So, this trip happened really last minute, but I'm so hyped to be here.",
    "index": 11
  },
  {
    "start": 93.72,
    "end": 99.08,
    "text": "I think for my breakfast this morning, I'm going to get uh bagel, egg, and cheese.",
    "index": 12
  },
  {
    "start": 99.08,
    "end": 106.34046511627906,
    "text": "By the way, if you're wondering what's in this kawaii bag, it is the Insta360 and Hello Kitty collaboration.",
    "index": 13
  },
  {
    "start": 106.34046511627906,
    "end": 107.32,
    "text": "Look at this.",
    "index": 14
  },
  {
    "start": 107.32,
    "end": 109.08,
    "text": "So cute.",
    "index": 15
  },
  {
    "start": 109.08,
    "end": 111.28,
    "text": "Kawaii so.",
    "index": 16
  },
  {
    "start": 111.28,
    "end": 113.45,
    "text": "I haven't actually even peeled the cover, but look at her.",
    "index": 17
  },
  {
    "start": 113.45,
    "end": 114.2,
    "text": "Look at her.",
    "index": 18
  },
  {
    "start": 114.2,
    "end": 117.08,
    "text": "Look at her.",
    "index": 19
  },
  {
    "start": 117.24,
    "end": 118.92,
    "text": "Do you see this?",
    "index": 20
  },
  {
    "start": 118.92,
    "end": 122.08,
    "text": "This is what I'm going to be vlogging with while I'm in New York.",
    "index": 21
  },
  {
    "start": 122.08,
    "end": 123.88,
    "text": "Let me just show you what's in my bag.",
    "index": 22
  },
  {
    "start": 123.88,
    "end": 127.56,
    "text": "This one is the Insta360 phone holder.",
    "index": 23
  },
  {
    "start": 127.56,
    "end": 129.44914285714287,
    "text": "It's also baby pink and cute.",
    "index": 24
  },
  {
    "start": 129.44914285714287,
    "end": 132.12,
    "text": "It's going to match my Crocs in a second.",
    "index": 25
  },
  {
    "start": 132.12,
    "end": 140.72,
    "text": "And then it also comes with these two accessories and I like that the back comes with all these compartments so that you can just put it in.",
    "index": 26
  },
  {
    "start": 140.72,
    "end": 144.83733333333333,
    "text": "This one is their obviously hands-free magnetic pendant.",
    "index": 27
  },
  {
    "start": 144.83733333333333,
    "end": 150.12,
    "text": "You put it underneath your shirt and you can kind of have like the go part be floating, like this part, because it's detachable.",
    "index": 28
  },
  {
    "start": 150.12,
    "end": 151.92,
    "text": "You can just put this on like this.",
    "index": 29
  },
  {
    "start": 151.92,
    "end": 152.91578947368419,
    "text": "Super easy.",
    "index": 30
  },
  {
    "start": 152.91578947368419,
    "end": 162,
    "text": "And then this one, you can also just put the go here and then you can clip it on to different places, like your cap or wherever.",
    "index": 31
  },
  {
    "start": 162,
    "end": 165.6,
    "text": "It's adjustable as well, so you can kind of like prop your camera like this.",
    "index": 32
  },
  {
    "start": 165.6,
    "end": 168.1856,
    "text": "And it's just so like kawaii so.",
    "index": 33
  },
  {
    "start": 168.1856,
    "end": 169.64,
    "text": "This is my outfit.",
    "index": 34
  },
  {
    "start": 169.64,
    "end": 175.3684210526316,
    "text": "Obviously, I have my Crocs on and it matches with the Hello Kitty Insta360 Go Ultra.",
    "index": 35
  },
  {
    "start": 175.3684210526316,
    "end": 177.32631578947368,
    "text": "I'm slightly afraid.",
    "index": 36
  },
  {
    "start": 177.32631578947368,
    "end": 179.48000000000002,
    "text": "I feel too cute today.",
    "index": 37
  },
  {
    "start": 180.2,
    "end": 187.72,
    "text": "So I think this morning I'm going to go to Rolling Bagels because I'm in a desperate need of a bagel egg and cheese. Like, oh my god, look at that.",
    "index": 38
  },
  {
    "start": 187.72,
    "end": 190.76,
    "text": "That looks so insanely good.",
    "index": 39
  },
  {
    "start": 190.76,
    "end": 195.76,
    "text": "Okay, it's like a 7-minute walk and obviously I'm walking the wrong way. 50/50 chance.",
    "index": 40
  },
  {
    "start": 195.76,
    "end": 198.98060526315788,
    "text": "It's always going to be the other 50 chance for me.",
    "index": 41
  },
  {
    "start": 198.98060526315788,
    "end": 205.32,
    "text": "So this is actually my first time in Long Island City and I was literally telling my friends yesterday like how many freaking Asians there are.",
    "index": 42
  },
  {
    "start": 205.32,
    "end": 214.11985714285714,
    "text": "It's like 85% predominantly Asian and they're all like in bad finance, tech, or law area-ish because it's so close to midtown.",
    "index": 43
  },
  {
    "start": 214.11985714285714,
    "end": 217.239,
    "text": "Oh, this is the place we went to eat last night.",
    "index": 44
  },
  {
    "start": 217.239,
    "end": 219.0717272727273,
    "text": "It was called Matsunori.",
    "index": 45
  },
  {
    "start": 219.0717272727273,
    "end": 220.52263636363637,
    "text": "It was really good.",
    "index": 46
  },
  {
    "start": 220.52263636363637,
    "end": 224.69,
    "text": "Like fresh hand rolls, but I didn't film much yesterday because babe, I just arrived in New York.",
    "index": 47
  },
  {
    "start": 224.69,
    "end": 225.88,
    "text": "You know what I mean?",
    "index": 48
  },
  {
    "start": 225.88,
    "end": 227.1557894736842,
    "text": "It's so beautiful.",
    "index": 49
  },
  {
    "start": 227.1557894736842,
    "end": 229.92,
    "text": "There's so many children and dogs here.",
    "index": 50
  },
  {
    "start": 229.92,
    "end": 239.6,
    "text": "Another thing I've really missed about New York is just how many food trucks there are and it's such an easy way to grab and go especially like if you don't want to sit down and you're traveling alone.",
    "index": 51
  },
  {
    "start": 239.6,
    "end": 243.41870967741934,
    "text": "You can just grab something quick in the morning so that you can get on with your day and I love that.",
    "index": 52
  },
  {
    "start": 243.41870967741934,
    "end": 249.56,
    "text": "Got my everything bagel with the sausage, egg and cheese.",
    "index": 53
  },
  {
    "start": 256.762,
    "end": 258.782,
    "text": "[music]",
    "index": 54
  },
  {
    "start": 268.68,
    "end": 280,
    "text": "Everyday in school when I was in high school like even though there was food always at the cafeteria, if you paid like you could get like bagel egg and cheese with sausage and I would always get that.",
    "index": 55
  },
  {
    "start": 280,
    "end": 283.96,
    "text": "Sausage was always like a dollar extra but you got to get the sausage. $8 sausage egg and cheese huh?",
    "index": 56
  },
  {
    "start": 283.96,
    "end": 288.08,
    "text": "I mean last time I ordered a sausage egg and cheese it was like 10 years ago.",
    "index": 57
  },
  {
    "start": 288.08,
    "end": 290.32,
    "text": "So considering inflation it's like not bad.",
    "index": 58
  },
  {
    "start": 290.32,
    "end": 294.4,
    "text": "That's always the bite that reminds me I'm in New York.",
    "index": 59
  },
  {
    "start": 294.4,
    "end": 297.88,
    "text": "I'm so happy right now.",
    "index": 60
  },
  {
    "start": 298.683,
    "end": 300.703,
    "text": "[music]",
    "index": 61
  },
  {
    "start": 304.578,
    "end": 306.59799999999996,
    "text": "[music]",
    "index": 62
  },
  {
    "start": 311.783,
    "end": 313.803,
    "text": "[music]",
    "index": 63
  },
  {
    "start": 329,
    "end": 334.64,
    "text": "I've somehow managed to affix the phone with the elastic string that the City Bike comes in.",
    "index": 64
  },
  {
    "start": 334.64,
    "end": 337.2051282051282,
    "text": "This is my first time riding a City Bike.",
    "index": 65
  },
  {
    "start": 337.2051282051282,
    "end": 339.52,
    "text": "Not going to lie, it's kind of scary.",
    "index": 66
  },
  {
    "start": 352.36,
    "end": 356.8,
    "text": "Oh, it's so nice to bike in New York.",
    "index": 67
  },
  {
    "start": 359.96,
    "end": 364.24,
    "text": "If a rich girl from Calabasas can do it, so can I.",
    "index": 68
  },
  {
    "start": 364.24,
    "end": 370.3323076923077,
    "text": "I am sweaty and it just started raining, so perfect timing because I brought my windbreaker.",
    "index": 69
  },
  {
    "start": 370.3323076923077,
    "end": 375.68,
    "text": "So, I bike this route right here, as you can see, and it was nice.",
    "index": 70
  },
  {
    "start": 375.68,
    "end": 381.2,
    "text": "Honestly, a little bit scary in the beginning and the bike is pretty heavy, so going up Williams Bridge was a little tough, but not bad.",
    "index": 71
  },
  {
    "start": 381.2,
    "end": 385.08,
    "text": "You see so much of New York by biking.",
    "index": 72
  },
  {
    "start": 390.384,
    "end": 392.404,
    "text": "[music]",
    "index": 73
  },
  {
    "start": 396.4,
    "end": 399.44,
    "text": "Hi, how are you?",
    "index": 74
  },
  {
    "start": 400.72,
    "end": 405.5028571428572,
    "text": "Wow, it's been a long time since I came into a bodega.",
    "index": 75
  },
  {
    "start": 405.5028571428572,
    "end": 408.16,
    "text": "I'm going to get a cold drink.",
    "index": 76
  },
  {
    "start": 413.52,
    "end": 416.64,
    "text": "Got a chocolate chip cookie.",
    "index": 77
  },
  {
    "start": 420.48,
    "end": 423.789,
    "text": "No rain will deter me from a cookie.",
    "index": 78
  },
  {
    "start": 423.789,
    "end": 425.80899999999997,
    "text": "[music]",
    "index": 79
  },
