  },
  {
    "start": 565.271,
    "end": 567.2909999999999,
    "text": "[bell]",
    "index": 120
  },
  {
    "start": 573.08,
    "end": 574.1956756756757,
    "text": "I'm so done.",
    "index": 121
  },
  {
    "start": 574.1956756756757,
    "end": 576.52,
    "text": "My legs are so I'm tired.",
    "index": 122
  },
  {
    "start": 576.52,
    "end": 582.4,
    "text": "I like from LIC to Chinatown and from Chinatown to Google 9.",
    "index": 123
  },
  {
    "start": 582.4,
    "end": 585.3199999999999,
    "text": "on a city bike.",
    "index": 124
  },
  {
    "start": 590.816,
    "end": 593.491,
    "text": "[bell] [music]",
    "index": 125
  },
  {
    "start": 596.056,
    "end": 598.076,
    "text": "[music]",
    "index": 126
  },
  {
    "start": 604.571,
    "end": 606.591,
    "text": "[music]",
    "index": 127
  },
  {
    "start": 622.4,
    "end": 628.64,
    "text": "We're in Harlem and I really was craving some soul food so we're at Sylvia's.",
    "index": 128
  },
  {
    "start": 628.64,
    "end": 631.4399999999999,
    "text": "Oh daddy.",
    "index": 129
  },
  {
    "start": 632.082,
    "end": 634.102,
    "text": "[music]",
    "index": 130
  },
  {
    "start": 641.907,
    "end": 643.927,
    "text": "[music]",
    "index": 131
  },
  {
    "start": 644.36,
    "end": 647.24,
    "text": "Hello Kitty.",
    "index": 132
  },
  {
    "start": 648.28,
    "end": 652.78,
    "text": "Actually I'll show you this bag that I'm carrying.",
    "index": 133
  },
  {
    "start": 652.78,
    "end": 665.3866666666667,
    "text": "It's like all like built in so they did like a collaboration with Hello Kitty and then it's like the avatar I guess and then it has all the I'm so excited.",
    "index": 134
  },
  {
    "start": 665.3866666666667,
    "end": 674.002,
    "text": "We decided to go for chicken livers, fried chicken with a side of mac and cheese, uh collard greens, one extra cornbread.",
    "index": 135
  },
  {
    "start": 674.002,
    "end": 676.0219999999999,
