    "text": "Hop on.",
    "index": 147
  },
  {
    "start": 775.72,
    "end": 780.04,
    "text": "I parked my I parked my bike, but this isn't like a system that I'm used to.",
    "index": 148
  },
  {
    "start": 780.04,
    "end": 781.2594285714285,
    "text": "How did this Oh, fuck.",
    "index": 149
  },
  {
    "start": 781.2594285714285,
    "end": 782.5342857142857,
    "text": "I almost lost my phone.",
    "index": 150
